msgid "Launch"
msgstr "Ouvrir"

msgid "Move to the app menu"
msgstr "Installer"

msgid "Move all to the app menu"
msgstr "Tout installer"

msgid "Apps to integrate"
msgstr "Applications à installer"

msgid "Integrating..."
msgstr "Installation…"

msgid "AppImage integrated"
msgstr "AppImage installée"

msgid "AppImages integrated"
msgstr "AppImages installées"

msgid "Already integrated"
msgstr "Déjà installée"

msgid "This AppImage is already integrated"
msgstr "Cette AppImage est déjà installée"

msgid "Version {version} is already integrated"
msgstr "La version {version} est déjà installée"

msgid "Built for {arch}; it will not be integrated"
msgstr "Compilée pour {arch} ; elle ne sera pas installée"

msgid "No AppImage could be integrated"
msgstr "Aucune AppImage n'a pu être installée"

msgid "None of the selected AppImages can be integrated"
msgstr "Aucune des AppImages sélectionnées ne peut être installée"

msgid "Integrated {done} of {total}"
msgstr "{done} sur {total} installées"

msgid "{done} integrated; {remaining} pending"
msgstr "{done} installées ; {remaining} en attente"

msgid "Show integrated AppImages outside the default folder"
msgstr "Afficher les AppImages installées en dehors du dossier par défaut"

msgid ""
"List AppImages that have been integrated into the system menu but are "
"located outside the default folder"
msgstr ""
"Liste les AppImages installées dans le menu système mais situées en "
"dehors du dossier par défaut"

msgid "Use executable name for integrated terminal apps"
msgstr ""
"Utiliser le nom de l'exécutable pour les applications de terminal "
"installées"

msgid "Installed"
msgstr "Installées"

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is not integrated into your desktop yet. Choose how it "
"should be installed and where to keep your AppImages."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR n'est pas encore installé sur votre bureau. Choisissez "
"comment l'installer et où conserver vos AppImages."

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR will be removed together with its desktop entry and the "
"application will close. Removing only Gear LeverR keeps the other "
"AppImages integrated."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR sera supprimé avec son entrée de menu et l'application se "
"fermera. Supprimer uniquement Gear LeverR conserve les autres "
"AppImages installées."

msgid ""
"Gear LeverR is the only integrated AppImage. It will be removed and "
"the application will close."
msgstr ""
"Gear LeverR est la seule AppImage installée. Elle sera supprimée et "
"l'application se fermera."

msgid ""
"This removes all {count} integrated AppImages, including Gear LeverR, "
"and the application will close."
msgstr ""
"Cela supprime les {count} AppImages installées, y compris Gear "
"LeverR, et l'application se fermera."

msgid ""
"{count} of the selected AppImages have the same name as an app that "
"is already integrated."
msgstr ""
"{count} des AppImages sélectionnées portent le même nom qu'une "
"application déjà installée."
